Parts library

Protasena's parts library is converted from KiCad's official symbol and footprint libraries
(https://gitlab.com/kicad/libraries), Copyright the KiCad Library Team and contributors, licensed
under the Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International licence with the KiCad
libraries' design exception. The converted pack is distributed separately, with KiCad's licence
and attribution files, in the KaanAlper/Protasena-library repository; it is not part of this
repository and is not covered by this repository's licence. The KiCad file reader in
crates/kicad is written from KiCad's published file format documentation and contains no KiCad
code. Protasena is not affiliated with the KiCad project.

